        "ImageDescription": {
          "value": "Veg Manchurian is a tasty Indo Chinese dish of fried veggie balls in a spicy, sweet and tangy sauce. There are 2 popular variations of making veg manchurian.\n<p>1.Veg Manchurian Gravy (With Sauce) – Makes for a tasty Chinese Main Course. Goes best with fried rice, schezwan fried rice or steamed rice.\n</p>\n2.Veg Manchurian Dry – An excellent starter snack or as a side dish with hakka noodles or chow mein.",
